[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 786.47, "timestamp": "00:13:06", "text": "阿贊送給我的禮物。  他幫我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 790.389, "timestamp": "00:13:10", "text": "把那個電路板和那個東西都寫了程式碼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 794.59, "timestamp": "00:13:14", "text": "。你好，阿斯特拉，歡迎光臨。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 797.11, "timestamp": "00:13:17", "text": "晚安.我正在為自己制定一個類似活動"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 800.23, "timestamp": "00:13:20", "text": "系統的方法。也就是說，如果我在吃飯、休息、上廁所、離開電腦、靜音、睡覺、打盹，我必須手動按下這些按鈕。例如，如果我處於 AFK 狀態，你會看到一個彈出窗口，YouTube 和 Twitch 上的活動狀態將顯示為 AFK。如果我的麥克風靜音，你會看到不同的訊息。此外，他的麥克風也被靜音了。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 812.35, "timestamp": "00:13:32", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Daamn"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 821.563, "timestamp": "00:13:41", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Joq's Activity State is AFK"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 824.23, "timestamp": "00:13:44", "text": "你看，你也看到了這個圖標，對吧？我希望你能做到。對，就是這樣。  所以，我們今天就做到了。嗯，我有一個用來睡覺，一個用來"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 827.67, "timestamp": "00:13:47", "text": "打盹，一個用來上廁所，一個用來做個人事，一個用來聽音樂，一個用來學習，一個用來休息"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 835.293, "timestamp": "00:13:55", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Joq's Activity State is Mic-Muted"}]